    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo are delighted to present 130 Willow Park Grove to the market. This semi-detached home boasts a long rear garden and offers great scope for extension to both the rear and side (STPP). Superbly located in this mature residential estate, the property will appeal to first-time buyers and families looking to trade up.\r\n\r\nThe house itself comprises a hallway, living room, dining room, kitchen, and bathroom. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a separate bathroom and WC. Most of the garage space at the side of the house has been maintained while part of it has been used to install the bathroom on the ground floor. While the house has been well maintained, it would benefit from some modernisation.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nWillow Park Grove is a mature and highly regarded residential location in Glasnevin, Dublin 11. Characterised by established family homes, generous gardens and attractive green spaces, the area offers a peaceful suburban setting while remaining within easy reach of Dublin city centre. The neighbourhood is particularly popular with families and benefits from a strong sense of community, with a wide range of everyday amenities close at hand.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptionally well served by schools and recreational amenities. Dublin City University is within easy reach, while nearby primary and secondary schools include Glasnevin National School, Glasnevin Educate Together, Scoil Mobhí, Corpus Christi, Scoil Chaitríona and Holy Faith. Residents can also enjoy convenient access to the National Botanic Gardens, Griffith Park and a variety of local sports clubs, shops, cafés and restaurants.\r\n\r\nTransport links are excellent, with regular bus services providing convenient access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M1 and M50 motorways are both readily accessible, making the location particularly convenient for commuters, while Dublin Airport is also within a short drive. Combining a mature residential setting with excellent schools, amenities and transport connections, Willow Park Grove is an ideal location for those seeking comfortable family living within easy reach of the city.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
